This is not a model.

A real one is 4 to 50MB of weights with a licence, a training provenance and
an input tensor shape, and none of those belong in a git repository shared by
several appliances. Drop yours in beside this file as model.tflite and the
overlay carries it; the solution hash then covers its contents, which is the
whole point — "which model shipped on which device" gets an answer rather
than a spreadsheet.

  cp ~/models/yolov5n-int8.tflite packs/inference/files/opt/inference/model.tflite
  silt hash --solution images/qemu-arm-vision.sx --buildroot ~/buildroot --pack packs/inference

inference.service refuses to start while only this placeholder is present,
which is better than starting and quietly inferring nothing.
